    id: clangreet
    text: How does your clan greet its elder?
    kind: Culture
    effect: 
    reveals: WrongClanLore
    citizen:
    - With {greeting}, of course.
    - '{greeting}. Every hatchling knows.'
    - By {greeting}.
    human:
